# Constrained NVE: a free rigid water molecule.
#
# No thermostat and no barostat, so the total energy is a real conserved
# quantity and any drift is the integrator's own. `velocity_init input` takes
# the velocities from the .xyz, so the run is deterministic with no RNG.
#
# COM removal is OFF on purpose: the fixture carries a deliberate centre-of-mass
# velocity, and the straight-line motion of the COM is one of the analytic
# results the case checks.
velocity 300.0
time_step 0.5
run 400
output_interval 10
velocity_init input
remove_com_velocity false
molecular_nonbonded special

constraints on
constraint_tolerance 1e-10
constraint_max_iterations 500

write_checkpoint_every 400
checkpoint_file nve_final.gmdchk
